# Stormkeld Prowler (2/1) puts two +1/+1 counters on itself whenever its controller casts a spell with mana value 5 or greater (CR 603.2).
# Amphin Cutthroat (mana value 4, one under the limit) leaves it a 2/1; Ancient Carp (mana value 5, exactly the limit) makes it 4/3; and
# Bot2's own Ancient Carp, cast in between, is not a spell Bot1 cast, so it stays 4/3 (the trigger asks whose spell it is).

[Bot1 Deck]
Stormkeld Prowler
Mox Sapphire
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Mox Emerald
Amphin Cutthroat
Ancient Carp
Island x20

